+
+// ============================================================================
+// Decision Alpha Lab - STC/SMT Cycles Offline License Types
+// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// Offline, fail-closed, signed-license contract for EX5 distribution.
+// This layer is intentionally operational and must never create, filter, or
+// reinterpret divergence / cycle / execution logic. It only permits or blocks
+// runtime execution.
